</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/4eab3bee-9cdd-11f1-853b-005056bfb2b6/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-08-20T153741Z-1726519747-RC2F2NAG98JE-RTRMADP-3-USA-TRUMP.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/4eab3bee-9cdd-11f1-853b-005056bfb2b6/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-08-20T153741Z-1726519747-RC2F2NAG98JE-RTRMADP-3-USA-TRUMP.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">547a44f2-9cdd-11f1-a4b2-8b8d3255f4a6</guid><pubDate>Thu, 20 Aug 2026 21:23:03 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/4eab3bee-9cdd-11f1-853b-005056bfb2b6/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-08-20T153741Z-1726519747-RC2F2NAG98JE-RTRMADP-3-USA-TRUMP.jpg">REUTERS - Kevin Lamarque</source><dc:creator>安娜</dc:creator></item><item><category>中国</category><title>华盛顿指责北京任意拘留第二位美国公民</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/cn/%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD/20260820-%E5%8D%8E%E7%9B%9B%E9%A1%BF%E6%8C%87%E8%B4%A3%E5%8C%97%E4%BA%AC%E4%BB%BB%E6%84%8F%E6%8B%98%E7%95%99%E7%AC%AC%E4%BA%8C%E4%BD%8D%E7%BE%8E%E5%9B%BD%E5%85%AC%E6%B0%91</link><description>
